SourceFile <-- SKIP TopLevel*
TopLevel   <-- FuncDecl

FuncDecl   <== `func` @Name Signature `{` Statement* @`}`
Signature  <-- @`(` Params? @`)` Type~?
Params     <-- Param (`,` @Param)*
Param      <-- Name @Type
Type       <-- Name

Statement  <-- SKIP (Return / IfStmt / Assign / ExprStmt)
Return     <== `return` @Expr @`;`~?
IfStmt     <== `if` @Cond `{` Statement* @`}` (`else` IfStmt / `else` `{` Statement* @`}`)~?
Assign     <== ExprName `=` Expr @`;`~?
ExprStmt   <-- Call `;`~?

Expr       <-- AddSub
Cond       <-- AddSub opcmp*
AddSub     <-- MulDiv opadd*
MulDiv     <-- Unary opmul*
Unary      <-- Primary
Primary    <-- Number / Call / ExprName / `(` @Expr @`)`

Call       <== Name `(` (Expr (`,` @Expr)*)? @`)`
ExprName   <-- Name
Name       <-- !Keyword %s* {[_%a][_%w]*} SKIP
Number     <-- %s* {[+-]? %d+} -> tonumber SKIP

opadd      :BinOp <== (`+`->'add' / `-`->'sub') MulDiv
opmul      :BinOp <== (`*`->'mul' / `/`->'div') Unary
opcmp      :BinOp <== (`==`->'eq' / `!=`->'ne' / `<=`->'le' / `>=`->'ge' / `<`->'lt' / `>`->'gt') AddSub

Keyword    <-- `func` / `if` / `else` / `return`
NAME_SUFFIX <-- [_%w]+
SKIP       <-- (%s / LINEBREAK)*
LINEBREAK  <-- `//` (!LINEBREAK_RAW .)* LINEBREAK_RAW / LINEBREAK_RAW
LINEBREAK_RAW <-- %cn %cr? / %cr
